<title>INDIA: India Century to meet on May 6 for bonus.</title>
<headline>India Century to meet on May 6 for bonus.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of Century Textiles and Industries Ltd will meet on May 6 to consider an issue of bonus equity shares, the company said in a note to the Bombay Stock Exchange on Monday.  </p>
<p>At the same meeting the board will finalise accounts for the year ended March 31, 1997, and recommend a dividend, it said.</p>
<p>The board will also consider a ten-for-one stock split, under which it will sub-divide the 100-rupee face value stock into 10-rupee shares, it added.</p>
<p>--Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
</text>
